{"status":"answered","claims":[{"text":"管理层对 Google Cloud 变化的解释是：2026 年第二季度和前六个月的收入同比大幅增加，主要由 Google Cloud Platform 的增长推动，尤其是基础设施和平台服务；此外，自 2026 年第二季度起开始确认 TPU systems 销售收入。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000614-db3885c5","quote":"Google Cloud revenues increased $11.1 billion and $18.9 billion"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000614-db3885c5","quote":"primarily driven by growth in Google Cloud Platform largely from infrastructure and platform services"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000614-db3885c5","quote":"we began recognizing revenue from the sale of TPU systems"}]},{"text":"从数字上看，2026 年第二季度 Google Cloud 收入为 246.68 亿美元，对比 2025 年同期为 136.24 亿美元；前六个月为 447.96 亿美元，对比 2025 年同期为 258.84 亿美元，文中也直接归纳为第二季度收入同比增加 111 亿美元、增长 82%。","citations":[{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000596-9dd0ee91","quote":"Google Cloud13,624 24,768 25,884 44,796"},{"document_id":"alphabet-000165204426000071","index_id":"didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5","block_id":"block-000579-3f55cf63","quote":"an increase in Google Cloud revenues of $11.1 billion, or 82%"}]}],"limitations":["未找到 2026 Q2 earnings call transcript/问答记录，因此无法区分电话会口径与 10-Q 书面披露口径。","问题要求“如何解释变化”，可用材料中只有 10-Q 的 MD&A 段落，没有额外管理层口头评论。"],"findings":["本地已提供的是 Alphabet 2026-06-30 10-Q，而不是单独的 2026 Q2 earnings call 逐字稿；因此只能依据这份 10-Q 中管理层对 Google Cloud 变化的书面解释回答。"],"stop_reason":"已在本地材料中定位到 2026-06-30 10-Q 的 MD&A 与表格，足以回答 Google Cloud 变化的书面解释。"}
